---@field repo string The name of the repository without the `.git` extension. The name is not case sensitive.
---@field pull_number number The number that identifies the pull request.
---@field commit_title? string Title for the automatic commit message. Only supported for direct merges.
---@field commit_message? string Extra detail to append to automatic commit message. Only supported for direct merges.
---@field sha? string SHA that pull request head must match to allow merge. If not provided, the current head of the PR at the time of the request will be used; if the PR is pushed in between the merge being requested and being executed, the merge will be cancelled.
---@field merge_method? github.pulls.MergeAsyncRequestMergeMethod|string The merge method to use for a direct merge. Only supported for direct merges.
---@field merge_action? github.pulls.MergeAsyncRequestMergeAction|string The action that will be taken to merge the pull request. `direct_merge` merges the pull request directly without using a merge queue; `merge_queue` adds the pull request to a merge queue; `default` uses a merge queue if one is configured for the target branch, or merges directly otherwise. If omitted, defaults to `default`.
---@field bypass_rules? boolean Whether to bypass repository rules that the authenticated actor is permitted to bypass.

